# Game car 1, first sheet. PDF page 11, block C.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
chip F4 7408
chip G4 7432
chip G5 7420
chip E5 74193
chip L8 7404
chip E6 74151
# Fixed 2026-11-05: F6.7 (ENP) follows the 5ART3/5CRT3 wire; pin 10 alone is ARTG/CRTG. Death Race 7C/7N agree.
chip F6 74161
chip F5 7400
chip G16 7402
prom D5 82S123 34
# Pin 4 follows L8.12 (5CCT2), not the pre-inverter CCT2 wire.
chip C5 74174
chip K8 7486
chip D6 74161
chip C6 74161
chip E4 7404

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net CTWD F4.11 G4.12
net 5CRT3 F4.12 F6.7 L8.10 G16.5 F5.4
net 1DGUT F4.13 F5.5
net CTWE G4.11 G5.5 G5.9
net CTWF G4.13 E6.5
net 5CPRS F4.8 E5.11
net 5ECDG F4.9
net 5LWTD F4.10
net 6CQLT G5.6 E5.4
net DLFT G5.1
net CRTG G5.2 G5.12 F6.10 F4.6
net 1KQ07 G5.4 G5.10 F5.10
net 6CQRT G5.8 E5.5
net 5DLFT G5.13
net GND E5.14 E5.15 E5.1 E5.10 E6.1 E6.3 E6.4 F6.3 F6.4 F6.5 F6.6 D5.14 D5.15
net C999 E5.9 E6.2 F6.1 C5.1 D6.1 D6.5 D6.6 D6.10 C6.1 C6.5 C6.6 C6.10 BOARD
net CCT0 E5.3 E6.13 E6.15 D5.10
net CCT1 E5.2 E6.14 D5.11
net CCT2 E5.6 L8.13 D5.12
net CCT3 E5.7 D5.13 C5.3
net NC E5.13 E5.12 E6.6 F6.15 D6.11 D6.12 D6.13 D6.14 C6.11 C6.12 C6.13 C6.14
net 5CCT2 L8.12 C5.4
net CRT3 E6.7 F6.11 L8.11
net CRT2 E6.9 F6.12
net CRT1 E6.10 F6.13
net CRT0 E6.11 F6.14
net OPEN E6.12
net 6TQLC F6.2 D6.2
net 5CRTL F6.9 F5.3
net DGGT F5.1
net TLGX F5.2
net TLC0 F4.4
net TLGZ F4.5
net 2CQTN G16.4
net 6TQGX G16.6
net CKC0 D5.1
net CKC1 D5.2
net CKC2 D5.3
net CKC3 D5.4
net CLL0 D5.5 C5.14
net CLL1 D5.6 C5.13
net CEL0 D5.7 C5.11
net CEL1 D5.9 C5.6
net 6CQUT C5.9 F5.8
net 1CCT3 C5.2 K8.12
net 6CCT2 C5.5 K8.13
net 1CEL1 C5.7 C6.4
net 1CEL0 C5.10 C6.3
net 1CLL1 C5.12 D6.4
net 1CLL0 C5.15 D6.3
net CGT2 K8.11
net CEUT F5.6 F5.9
net 5CLCC D6.7 E4.2
net 5TFGY D6.9 C6.9
net CLCC D6.15 E4.1
net 6TQ07 C6.2
net 5CECC C6.7 E4.4
net CECC C6.15 E4.3
